  "releaseNotes": "v0.4.0: Adds AnalyticalSummary + AnalyticalSummaryBuilder (compact model-facing chart snapshot — MA snapshots, MA60 deviation and slope via least-squares fit, drawdown from peak, change %, bounded key-turn list, per-indicator IndicatorCoverage with status + human-readable note) and a threshold-reversal ZigZag swing detector (Percent or ATR-multiple modes, strict peak/trough alternation, trailing tentative pivot). Additive — the existing public surface is unchanged. See https://github.com/redoxnet/mcp-lsopenapi/blob/main/RELEASENOTES.Core.md for full notes.",
